md(n,'XSS has been in every OWASP Top 10 since the first one. In the 2025 edition it sits under **A05 Injection**,','In the OWASP Top10 2025 edition, XSS is covered by **A05 Injection**,','Retain primaryverifiedcurrentclassification without unreviewedhistoricaleveryeditionclaim.')
md(n,'The flavours differ in **where the payload is stored** and **where it gets inserted**, which matters for detection and for which fix applies.','Persistence (stored versus reflected) and insertion mechanism (server versus client/DOM) are different axes. Stored data can cause DOM-based XSS too. The table gives common examples, not exclusive categories.','Correct overlappingXSSclassifications.')
