md(n,'The attacker has to get the victim to open a crafted link (a phishing email, a shortened URL). Each victim is attacked individually.','Delivery may use a crafted link, form submission or another request trigger. The payload is reflected from that request rather than stored for later delivery.','ReflectedXSSdoesnotrequireoneparticularlinkdelivery.')
